{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301706","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301706","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1230170601:1":{"text":"急いでるのは荷物を託してきた商人たちの方さ。","source_cn":"着急的是委托运输货物的商人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA000F8EA05905BEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230170602:1":{"text":"あいつら、毎日船長を急かしに来てたんだ。明日には目的地に着いてくれって。","source_cn":"他们每天都来催船长，恨不得我们明天就到达目的地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC821B5BFE59570AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230170603:1":{"text":"まぁ、航路の封鎖が解けたばかリだからな。ラスティーアンカーの商品は外じゃ人気なんだよ。","source_cn":"这也不怪他们，毕竟航路刚开，锈锚港的货物在外面可都是抢手货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF40969A8EEB710B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230170604:1":{"text":"時は金なり、グズグズしていられねぇ。帆を張れ、出航準備だ！","source_cn":"时间就是金钱。不能耽搁了，扬起风帆，准备出航！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BE389C9B36FADE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水手欧米拉":{"text":"水夫のオーミラ","source":"水手欧米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:船长布莱杰":{"text":"船長のブラッジェ","source":"船长布莱杰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}